      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قارحهُ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُقَارَحَةٌ</span>, (S, K,) (tropical:)  <i>He
